<bioghist encodinganalog="545$a">
<head>Biographical Information
</head>
<p>John Alexander Foster (1801-1874) and his wife Amelia Carlisle McAlexander (1807-1863) lived in Albemarle and Nelson Counties, Virginia.
</p>
</bioghist>

<scopecontent encodinganalog="520$a">
<head>Scope and Content
</head>
<p>This bible record documents the family of John Alexander Foster and his wife Amelia Carlisle McAlexander. It also mentions the parentage of John and Amelia.
</p>
<p>NOTES: Researchers must use the reproduction copies of the bible records. The original bible is in an archival box on the oversize shelf.
</p>
</scopecontent>

